  "description": "The Fox School of Business at Temple University has a distinguished tradition of preparing business leaders, professionals and entrepreneurs for successful careers. It is the largest, most comprehensive business school in the greater Philadelphia region. Thoroughly committed to providing student-centered education and professional development relevant to today’s digital, global economy — the Fox School integrates technology into the curriculum and classroom, and encourages entrepreneurship and innovation throughout its programs. The Fox School’s global presence, perspective, and strategic alliances with regional and international business communities position students among dominant and growth industries in financial services, healthcare, information technology, pharmaceuticals/biotechnology, and tourism and hospitality.",
